  "bodyHash": "ad6a01f9596403d3",
  "content": "\n\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">&nbsp;適用於 FORGE 1.16.5, 1.18.2,1.19.2,1.20.1</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">NEOFORGE 1.21.1</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Integrated API</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Create</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quark</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Supplementaries</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>選用整合模組：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes O&rsquo; Plenty</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Alex&rsquo;s Mobs</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Guard Villagers</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Artifacts</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes You&rsquo;ll Go</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Regions Unexplored</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Terralith</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Waystones</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Farmer&rsquo;s Delight</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ice and Fire</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ars Nouveau</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Archeology</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">_________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong><strong>什麼是「整合地牢與結構」？</strong></strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 整合地牢與結構（簡稱 IDAS）是一款模組，使用來自 Quark、Alex&rsquo;s Mobs 和 Create 的方塊與生物，加入高度細緻的結構，並可選用整合許多其他模組。我受夠了將結構類模組裝進整合包後在世界上漫遊，卻只看到原版物品，完全沒有任何挑戰性。我熱愛精緻的建築與 Create 機械模組，因此決定製作一款能補足我缺失的模組。打造充滿背景故事、美觀且具挑戰性的地牢與結構，並與多款核心 Forge 模組完全整合。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果你是該模組的新手，我強烈建議你尋找迷宮、工匠工作室、古代礦坑或掠奪者堡壘，並嘗試攻略它們。這些結構花費了最長時間來建造，我認為它們確實非常有趣且富有成就感。祝你好運！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>查看我的其他專案！</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，整合結構系列的官方整合包</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a><br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定與選用整合：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於 1.16</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">編輯設定檔<br>IDAS 會自動偵測是否已安裝 Ice and Fire，並調整部分結構的戰利品與生物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>適用於 1.18 以上版本</strong><br>若要啟用 BOP 整合，請下載此 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">資料包</span></span></a>。<br>若要啟用 Alex&rsquo;s Mobs 整合，請下載此 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要設定其他內容，請下載此 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要調整生成率，請修改結構組中的間距與分離值。間距（Spacing）是相鄰兩次生成嘗試之間的平均距離。數值介於 0 到 4096 之間<br>分離值（Separation）是相鄰兩次生成嘗試之間的最小距離（以區塊為單位）。數值介於 0 到 4096 之間。不能大於間距值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要編輯生態域，請修改 tags/worldgen/biome/has structure 中的生態域檔案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要停用結構，請將其標籤列表中的所有生態域移除，或將分離值與間距調至極高數值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要提升與其他結構模組的相容性，請將結構加入各 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 檔案中的「結構生成排除清單」</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>當使用全域資料包模組時，若同時使用了 BOP 與設定資料包，必須手動確保 BOP 整合的資料包位於設定資料包之上。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>功能與規劃中功能：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>主世界與下界包含超過 50 種獨特且高度細緻的結構，包括：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 20 種獨特的小型精緻世界建築結構，例如營地、市場、動物巢穴等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 7 種終局等級地牢，從廣闊的矮人礦坑到沙漠迷宮再到掠奪者堡壘</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 以 Create 為主題的地牢，包含旋轉致命機關，如工匠工作室</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 15 棟獨特的房屋與旅館，供疲憊的旅人歇息</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;- 6 座可供探索的魔法巫師與附魔塔</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 沉沒的海盜船</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 村民城堡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 下界中可供探索的魔法塔與傳送門</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp; 基於節慶活動的結構，例如冬季馬車與鬼屋莊園</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>規劃中功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 地下地牢變體</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 更多下界與終界結構</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-&nbsp;<strong>加入我的 Discord 提出建議，並投票決定下一個新增的結構！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>如果你難以找到其中任一結構，只需在聊天欄開始輸入 `<em>/locate idas</em>`，即可列出所有結構。例如，輸入 `<em>/locate idas:castle</em>` 即可定位距離你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>所有結構圖片</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>雄偉的迷宮，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>掠奪者堡壘，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>古代礦坑，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>法師塔樓，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附魔塔樓，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>廢棄房屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>城堡，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>磚房，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>小屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>鬼屋，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;熊爪旅館，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>沉船，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>獵人木屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>農舍，由&nbsp;Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>女巫樹樁，由&nbsp;Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>隱士幽谷，由&nbsp;Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>煉藥師住所，由&nbsp;Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>漁夫小屋，由 Nirze 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>紅角公會，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>養蜂人小屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>樹冠酒館，由 Howester1984 和&nbsp;chloe2cu 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>古代傳送門，由 CraisinLord 和 Nirze 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>工匠工作室，由 CraisinLord 和 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>死靈法師尖塔，由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>集市，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>鬧鬼莊園，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>冬季馬車，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>詭譎堡壘，由 CraisinLord 設計（僅限 Ice and Fire）</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><br>樞紐，由 Codex 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此結構中的傳送門包括：<br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>天界</p>\n<p>暮色森林</p>\n<p>阿蒙</p>\n<p>下界</p>\n<p>厄瑞波斯／地下花園</p>\n<p>蜜蜂界域</p>\n<p>伊甸之環</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>深淵遺跡，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>火車遺跡，由 brythonderos 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/820/362/2024-03-07_00.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>冰封墓穴，由 Darth Trayus 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/834/984/2024-03-12_11.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>挖掘現場，由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/364/2024-06-30_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>沙漠挖掘現場，由 Howester 1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/363/2024-07-01_16.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>工匠堡壘，由 Darth Trayus 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/361/2024-07-01_13.png\" width=\"592\" height=\"317\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>大魔導師塔樓，由 Cpt_Gloval 設計（需要安裝 Ars Nouveau）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/362/2024-07-01_14.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"314\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>廢棄燈塔，由 Ghast 設計<br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/88/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>收藏家博物館，由 Ghast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/982/2025-03-17_19.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>風蝕神壇，由 Jawredstoneguy 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/983/2025-03-15_23.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"318\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>海妖灣，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/928/2026-03-20_14-55-57-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>植物學家小屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/912/2026-03-20_14-46-06-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>圓木小屋，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/913/2026-03-20_14-48-39-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>廢棄葡萄園，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/925/2026-03-20_14-53-35-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>毀壞教堂，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/929/2026-03-20_14-50-22-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>破損要塞，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/926/2026-03-20_14-54-33-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>廢棄水井，由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/927/2026-03-20_14-55-17-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>石匠小屋，由 Qwerty 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/930/2026-03-20_14-53-04-png.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>都鐸酒吧，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/900/2026-03-20_14-16-24-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"460\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>奇趣雜貨店，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/908/2026-03-20_14-17-45-png.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"409\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>南瓜咖啡廳，由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1729/873/2026-06-11_10-53-24-png.png\" width=\"433\" height=\"353\"></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>常見問題：</strong></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：哪些生態系（Biome）模組相容？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：大多數生態系模組都相容，包括 Terralith、BOP 和 BYG。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：為什麼需要這麼多依賴項（Dependencies）？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：你會向下移植或更新到 ___ 嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：我會隨著依賴項的更新，持續將此模組更新至最新的 Minecraft 版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：這個模組能與其他結構模組一起使用嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：可以！Yung 的所有模組、Repurposed Structures 等都能完美運作，沒有任何問題。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：我可以將此模組用於模組整合包（Modpack）中嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：當然可以！非常歡迎大家將此模組收錄在整合包中。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：這個模組可以僅安裝在伺服器端嗎？<br>答：不行。由於它包含自訂音樂唱片與原聲帶，以及對客戶端結構方塊的修改，因此無法僅限伺服器端。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：所有想居住在這些結構裡的玩家：我該如何阻止怪物生成？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：試試看使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnum Torch Mod</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：Quark 中的哪些功能可以停用？&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：所有的技術性變更與紅石相關功能都可以順利停用。不過，IDAS 仍會使用所有建築用方塊。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是 KaupenJoe 製作的 </strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>極度</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;精彩的 IDAS 模組展示影片：</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5DU4DlTWQiw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"428\" height=\"428\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">我花費了超過 300 小時來建構與編寫此模組，甚至為此專門學習了 Java。如果你非常喜歡我的作品，支持我的兩個最佳方式是直接透過 Patreon，或是透過 Bisect Hosting 購買伺服器。點擊上方圖片即可租用伺服器，輸入我的優惠碼 CraisinCraft 可享首月 25% 折扣，盡情與好友同樂！設定非常簡單，幾乎只需一鍵完成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">點擊下方圖片前往我的 Patreon 頁面直接支持我。你將獲得專屬的 Discord 身份組、聊天頻道權限，並能直接影響 IDAS 的開發方向。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">特別感謝以下人士：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的贊助者們！！！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Howester1984、Nirze 以及 IDAS 建築團隊，感謝你們建造了本模組中許多精美的結構！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Cama，模組中那些驚人的音樂唱片的原作者</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fnighthearted%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nighthearted</a>，我參考了他們的城堡建築原始造型，並將其應用於掠奪者要塞中。不過方塊配色、內部設計及所有細節皆為本人原創。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Bisect Hosting 團隊，特別是 Perz，感謝你們為本模組設計了標誌！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">TelepathicGrunt，《Repurposed Structures》的作者。我在編寫程式時大量參考了該模組的檔案。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">YUNGNICKYOUNG，感謝他開發的結構模板管理器。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的貓 Fonzy，在我編寫整個模組時一直坐在我的腿上。膝上的重量確實能幫助我保持專注。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果您遇到任何問題或有建議，請點擊下方的圖片或連結加入 Discord。我會盡力回覆每位玩家，也非常歡迎提出寶貴建議！感謝大家遊玩並支持我的模組！</span>&nbsp;undefined</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
